  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">1</data>
  <data key="d36">0.55</data>
  <data key="d37">Frequent cross‑border strikes that disrupt global food and energy transit create immediate supply‑security pressures that drive BRICS members into ad hoc meetings and communiqués to align export controls, shipping routes and contingency policies.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d40">brics_china_india</data>
</edge>
