  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.8</data>
  <data key="d37">An uptick in cross‑border strikes that threaten production, pipelines, terminals or shipping routes raises the market's perceived risk of supply disruptions, causing crude oil prices to rise.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d40">global_bond_inflation</data>
