  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.55</data>
  <data key="d37">High-volume combat use of armed UAS in Ukraine accelerates tactical diffusion and market supply of proven drone kits and tactics to regional actors, enabling more frequent and effective strikes on shipping and energy infrastructure in the Gulf, raising incident frequency and severity.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d40">iran_gulf_chokepoints</data>
</edge>
