  <data key="d36">0.65</data>
  <data key="d37">Higher sortie rates and deployment of semi‑autonomous drones produce more failure modes, adversarial exploitation, and misidentification events that increase the frequency of reported and unreported AI safety and misuse incidents.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
