<edge source="russia_ukraine_war::weapons_and_aid_flow" target="brics_china_india::trade_investment_flow" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.8</data>
  <data key="d37">Sustained increases in Western weapons and aid to Ukraine prompt Russia to reroute energy, commodity exports and investment partnerships toward China and India to replace lost Western markets, directly raising trade and investment flows between Russia and BRICS partners.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d40">brics_china_india</data>
</edge>
<edge source="russia_ukraine_war::weapons_and_aid_flow" target="brics_china_india::financial_integration_de" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Larger Western arms and assistance packages increase the likelihood and severity of financial restrictions on Russia, incentivizing BRICS members to expand alternative payment channels, currency-swap arrangements and bilateral settlement mechanisms to preserve commerce with Russia.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d40">brics_china_india</data>
</edge>
<edge source="russia_ukraine_war::weapons_and_aid_flow" target="global_bond_inflation::long_term_gov_yield" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.65</data>
  <data key="d37">Sustained high-volume weapons and aid flows signal a protracted conflict, raising a geopolitical risk premium on sovereign debt and pushing up long-term government bond yields as investors demand higher compensation.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d40">global_bond_inflation</data>
</edge>
<edge source="russia_ukraine_war::weapons_and_aid_flow" target="us_allied_tech_rivalry::ai_capability_growth" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Large, sustained flows of weapons, sensors, and operational data into the theatre accelerate R&amp;D and field testing by allied contractors and researchers, speeding improvements in core AI models and specialist systems.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d40">us_allied_tech_rivalry</data>
</edge>
