  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.7</data>
  <data key="d37">An elevated systemic probability of geographic or institutional spillover from the Ukraine conflict increases insurers' and charterers' perceived exposure for tanker transits through Gulf chokepoints, pushing up war‑risk and security-related transport premiums almost immediately.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d40">iran_gulf_chokepoints</data>
</edge>
