  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Deeper China–India financial linkages and payment arrangements shorten settlement friction and enable faster payments to alternative suppliers and shipowners, increasing the speed and volume at which replacement crude and rerouted shipments can be mobilized after a disruption.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
