  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.75</data>
  <data key="d37">An uptick in China–BRICS trade and investment — including relaxed export controls or increased shipments of UAS components and dual‑use electronics from China — directly supplies Russia with parts and finished drones, enabling higher sortie rates in the theatre.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">brics_china_india</data>
  <data key="d40">russia_ukraine_war</data>
</edge>
