  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">A sustained increase in China–India trade and investment creates larger integrated markets and revenue streams for China/India-based AI firms, forcing US-allied firms to accelerate productization and market rollouts to defend market share.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
