  <data key="d37">Tighter financial conditions force firms to prioritize near-term revenue and cut discretionary spending, producing immediate reductions in budgets for internal safety teams, red‑teaming, audits, and rollout controls, lowering operational safety adoption.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-12 months</data>
