  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.55</data>
  <data key="d37">Faster core AI capability improvements accelerate allied and proxy deployment of improved ISR, autonomous maritime systems, and advanced cyber/targeting tools, lowering thresholds and increasing the frequency and precision of hostile incidents in Gulf chokepoints.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d39">us_allied_tech_rivalry</data>
  <data key="d40">iran_gulf_chokepoints</data>
