  <data key="d37">Faster core AI capability improvements enable more capable autonomous navigation, targeting, and swarm coordination that operators rapidly integrate into UAS fleets, increasing sortie rates and on‑front operational density.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d39">us_allied_tech_rivalry</data>
