  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.55</data>
  <data key="d37">A surge in commercialization by US‑allied AI firms squeezes market space for BRICS incumbents and creates coordinated competitive pressures, prompting BRICS governments to align industrial policy, align regulatory responses and negotiate joint measures to protect or subsidize domestic AI sectors.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
