  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.55</data>
  <data key="d37">A marked increase in allied regulatory intervention on AI raises expected long-run drag on productivity and tech-sector growth, reducing the term premium and putting downward pressure on long-term government yields.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d39">us_allied_tech_rivalry</data>
  <data key="d40">global_bond_inflation</data>
